Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)我来告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 即将揭晓的冲击真相～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)锵 锵锵～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在巴利安世界杀死你和纳修的人……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(杜尔贝)梅拉格……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.85,0:00:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我觉悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一回合 我要把你的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部 削光！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有本事就来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过哪怕只剩1点{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我受到的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同等伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.23,0:00:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会袭向你！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一想到能再一次亲手把你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送进地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让人热血沸腾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.87,0:00:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)闭嘴 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}背叛我们 你的所作所为{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 我必定会由我亲手 将他送入地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之后的事就拜托了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}扭曲水晶！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上存在水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 对手怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变化 变为２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此外我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 零之刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使对手１只怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 和「扭曲水晶」的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果结合起来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.19,0:01:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽攻击力……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会下降2000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 你这家伙干了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里 发动「拉格纳·无限」的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个「混沌超层单元」{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将变化后的数值份的伤害给予对手！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（梅拉格）盖丹斯 图 帕加特利！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真有你的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 在战斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.83,0:02:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算攻击「灵魂·玛丽欧内特」{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值 也不可能被削光！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.39,0:02:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:19.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动「零·刃」的更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这个效果 「拉格纳·无限」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.19,0:02:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以攻击２次！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.37,0:02:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 你对我们和纳修
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.51,0:02:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做过的事 必须付出代价！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 是我的份！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击灵魂玛丽安托！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)装备了 No.卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灵魂玛丽安托{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即使不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我还能再进行一次战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说这样一来 你就完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 这次是纳修的份！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再一次 攻击灵魂玛丽安托！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 伤害药罐 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以让战斗中的伤害无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 伤害被吸走了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没能把我的生命值全部削光！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动唐·千座的王座的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 受到的伤害全部复原！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵 多谢了 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:53.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你应该知道吧{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.95,0:03:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值恢复的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借索尔·马里奥内特的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:03:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相应的 攻击力会提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[显示器]然后 与恢复的生命值相同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数值的伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会袭向对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.65,0:04:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我受到的伤害是 3300。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 梅拉古酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.73,0:04:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定让你下地狱去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.62,0:04:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}索尔·马里奥内特的效果发动…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞德)等等 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.13,0:04:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要提升攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能发动拉格纳·无限的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.33,0:04:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我知道。但我现在的生命值是4000。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算吃下3300的伤害》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了梅拉格的魔法卡 扭曲水晶的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《唔 对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.37,0:04:49.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力的变化变成两倍的话 就是6600。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.85,0:04:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份伤害由我来…》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了不发动效果吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:57.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 你终于发现自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差点掉进地狱了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像注意到了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 只要发动灵魂操偶师的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙也会吃到伤害的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本来就是这么打算的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格。果然 你打算同归于尽……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能把他送进地狱……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…… 那这样的话 我就不用效果不就行了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.85,0:05:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本以为是无敌的你的连招被破了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再怎么自封为神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的力量也就那种程度……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区一只虫子少给我摆出一副什么都懂的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 嘴硬。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～ 耍我玩呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那好吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.63,0:05:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你们见识见识！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.35,0:05:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又再度揭晓 冲击的真相！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}锵锵锵锵～锵！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用基拉古设下陷阱把你坑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要干这种事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好看看 纳修的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.20,0:06:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是在哪见过？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.29,0:06:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那副样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)那家伙已经破烂不堪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我 就像这样 完好无损。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值好几次都被恢复过来了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧！ 你这家伙 纳修的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 发现了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 千尊之玉座的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复的生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部都是从纳修那里吸过来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 你们这帮家伙一直在削减纳修的生命啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(怒视)你们这些混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叛徒 阿里特还跟他手牵手一起出现了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢反抗咚·千尊大人你们这群蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)基拉古你被骗了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被咚·千尊改写了记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在被利用啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说我基拉古被骗被利用了……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们那腐烂的灵魂本大爷就一并吃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要把那家伙从 唐·千的咒缚中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能像我那时一样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)只能靠他使用的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超限红莲·No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用遗迹的 No.来击破。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.90,0:08:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就只能和他决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 我来做。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特… 可是 你！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 没错…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去了巴利安之力的 这个我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.34,0:09:13.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用不了超限红莲·No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 我必须去做的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.11,0:09:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 最好的搭档就是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了… 用这张卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯… 这张卡是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是基拉古遗迹的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那家伙解开基拉格的咒缚。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢啦 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.05,0:09:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特 拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.86,0:09:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不可以输哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！基拉格决斗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思 你这个背叛者！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就从你开始 吞噬灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把你变回原来的样子～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.19,0:10:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻归我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤燃烧纳克拉 大先锋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我再盖放２张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 阿里特～！我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的攻击竟然在削减纳修的性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:46.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……何等卑鄙！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.27,0:10:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们痛苦挣扎的那副模样我可真是受不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……连灵魂都彻底腐坏了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的荣耀英雄{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构为叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.72,0:11:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来吧 CNo.102！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多鲁贝）安霍利·雷击 高贵恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！要打倒现在的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯有必杀的一击！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那才能拯救纳修将我们引向胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中的魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神圣·射线 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让高贵恶魔的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.33,0:11:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升2000！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你提升攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.14,0:11:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样也没法一击打倒我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！高贵恶魔的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个混沌·超量·单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.99,0:12:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的效果无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其攻击力变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.02,0:12:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你受到的伤害就是4900。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一击就能削光你的生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 放心吧。为了不让你半路逃跑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会陪你一起下地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到神圣·裁决效果的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对对手玩家造成的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己也会承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙也想拼个同归于尽？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用高贵恶魔攻击索尔·马里奥内特！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我一起下地狱吧！贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞德)就是现在，贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 邪恶1 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中发生伤害的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！将怪兽的破坏无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且无论那个伤害是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值都保留1点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳…好险 好险…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就要和你手牵手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起下地狱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咳 居然还有那种卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可惜啊 多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.81,0:13:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点结束回合啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后贵族的攻击力恢复原状。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这一瞬间堂·萨赞德的王座效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.10,0:13:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修！！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是你们拼命挣扎的结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《没想到竟然会在关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用上事先盖下的邪恶1》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.09,0:14:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《啊啊 但这样一来就能把那帮家伙…》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.106！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:20.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}熔岩掌 巨人红手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就出王牌了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.65,0:14:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤火焰手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进一步{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤日珥之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有炎族怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的火焰之手和
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}日珥之手进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.58！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炎压鬼 燃烧者·钳嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从那个 No.中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感受到了千尊的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？ 那样的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕和阿里特那时一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了强化咒缚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是千尊赋予的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把所有的超量单元都用上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以装备到1只怪物·额外卡组怪兽上。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把燃烧·拜蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到巨型·汉德雷德上！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且！装备了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧·拜蛇的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以直接攻击对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.09,0:15:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奸笑)这样一来你就完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把永续陷阱 邪恶1送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以任意破坏1张！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)不过 用了这个效果的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就没法进行战斗了呐…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么那么要破坏哪一张呢～？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.82,0:16:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要破坏的是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我场上的伤害·壶！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.42,0:16:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的陷阱！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.56,0:16:36.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈 这家伙离开场上的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把刚才吸收的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予所有玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.13,0:16:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收的伤害是1300！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 我们全员{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.62,0:16:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}各自承受1300的伤害吃下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后你们下地狱 我没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜拜了 虫子们！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.97,0:17:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《梅拉格……》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 圣·护盾 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成的伤害发生全部{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 将无效化的伤害与相同数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.51,0:17:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天使族怪兽1只的攻击力可以提升。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将拉格纳·无限的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升3900！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.41,0:17:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害是3人份的意思吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力如果有6700的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝，这样一来下个我的回合就把那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格，永别了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个回合结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我因圣盾的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将无效掉的那部分伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部承受在自己身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起，梅拉格。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没能打倒那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请原谅无力的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你和纳修{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我来说 是无可替代的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为人类 作为巴利安{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能在两个世界相遇我感到很幸福。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢啊 梅拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到此 回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉古 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能和你们相遇真的 太好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.43,0:18:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 装备了燃烧者·拜瑟的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨型·红手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还早着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧者·拜瑟的恐怖现在才要开始呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙每次把1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.00,0:19:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对方造成500点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.13,0:19:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟…糟了！阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 再来一张！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:19:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我用更棒的声音叫出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了。快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 这是最后一张了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦 阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反击陷阱 超级燃烧 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在因伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值即将耗尽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之前 让生命值变为一半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将受到的伤害 变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连火焰都能烧尽的真正{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炽热的心!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}失去巴利安之力后 依然展现出精彩绝伦的战斗姿态。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！ 果然 你这家伙 太强了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝 你的心意我确实收到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你用生命换来的力量 我一定会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.35,0:21:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 觉悟吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借多鲁贝的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的 拉格纳·无限之
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是 6700。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.39,0:21:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽的攻击力是 零。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 怪兽效果也无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 拉格纳·无限之
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击 灵魂·马里奥内特!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一击 将粉碎你的生命！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.11,0:21:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝 我为你报仇了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场胜利正是因为有你赐予的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.99,0:23:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.80,0:23:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.63,0:23:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.25,0:23:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:02.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
